#1102
Natural Steps~
   Covering the small hill you are on are large rocks and roots that have been
placed in just the right places by nature to make a set of natural steps that
lead to and from the entrance at the top of the hill, and a small unused trail
that surrounds the hi You find it very intriguing, are these really natural
steps, or did the creators of this cavern you see the entrance at the top of
the hill place the rocks and make the roots grow so that it would only look
natural?  At the moment you aren't totally sure, but you now feel the urge to
get on with your journey, the steps themselves go north and south, but they are
also connected with other steps to the west.    
~
