#1104
A Trail~
   The ground here is bare and dry, some moss and grass grows around, but none
touches this small path that leads around the hill.  Even though the trail is
bare, it is rough and you cannot see where anyone else has walked here before.
You look down at the trail for a closer look and see that there are large
stepping stones buried in the ground, you can barely see the stops of them, it
seems that the dirt creates a thin almost transparent skin over the tops of
them.  This small trail runs a tight circle around this small hill, to both the
east and west.  Steps to your north will take you up the hill, but to the south
you would walk off the trail.    
~
