#1107
A Corner in the Clearing~
   The area here is clear, the ground is covered with beautiful green moss, and
you have a good view of a hill with a large entrance into the ground that sits
nearby in the center of this clearing.  Here you look around, there is not much
for you to see, the main attraction is in the center of the clearing.  This
place appears to be a corner of the clearing, the clearing is made in a perfect
square, but from where you are you can not tell where there has been any
activity in years.  You don't understand why the forest doesn't grow over this
area.    
~
