E
flower odd straing grass~
   After deciding to take a close look at a strange clump of grass, you wonder
why you ever wanted to in the first place.  So far the only thing you couldn't
get from a view at a distance was the smell, the plant emits a horrible stench
that smells about ten times worse than mildew with some other smell you can't
quite place added with it.  While still watching the plant, you begin to back
away from it, but just as you're doing that you see yet another peculiar thing,
the grass has strange retractable thorns, you will have to remember this.    
~
