#1121
A Sunken Alcove Among the Pillars~
   The clearing dips here into a shallow bowl of ground, as though the earth
had slowly swallowed something that once stood upon it.  Pillar drums lie
tumbled in the tall grass, each sheared clean through, and east the ground
rises again into the corner of the clearing.
~
