#1130
Inside the Eastern Entrance~
   At this point inside the entrance, it is not that easy to see where you are,
but any of your surroundings that you cannot see are atleast imaginable.  From
what you can tell, you have just stepped into a shelter basically inside of the
entrance.  As you glance to your east the only partial stone seperator between
this room and the next room reminds you that the entrance had two different
sides.  Trying to get a good close look at the walls, you notice a weird fungus
growing out of the stone itself, but that's about all there is to see.  After
getting bored with looking at strange fungus, you look north, and because of
the only partial dividing of the rooms, you can tell that both entrances merge
into one, you wonder why there were two in the first place.  Turning your head,
the exit out to the north becomes an obvious way out.    
