#1131
A Hallway~
   The walls inside this room are made of large black blocks that are covered
with a skin of very tiny rocks, none any bigger than the size of the top of
your fingernail.  You wonder if the wall was somehow made this way by the
beings that created the cave, or if it's some natural mineral that has grown
over the millenia.  In any case, it is not the sort of thing you would expect
to see down in some dank dark cave.  Looking up in the air, trying to find the
ceiling, there are thousands of tiny luminous objects floating around in the
sky, some sort of firefly maybe, but you cannot see the ceiling itself.  
Looking down there are five or six steps for walking down to another hallway,
what is inside that next room is hard to see.  The exit south appears to take
you inside of one of the large stone entrances to this cave.    
