#1134
The Connector~
   This room appears to be rather plain, with the exception of it's beautiful
green walls.  The walls are still made of the same black stone that the other
walls are made of, but it has an odd moss that seems to thrive in this area
growing on it.  Hanging from the ceiling are large stalactites, some drop water
onto the floor.  You catch yourself staring off into the darkness wondering
about who built this cave.  Taking your gaze off of the darkness and trying to
concentrate on your surroundings, you think you see something move on the other
side of the room.  Being a sort of connector, this part of the man-made cave
exits to rooms in both the north and west, and also connects with more of this
so-called hallway to the south.    
