dirt and rock walls, the floor being made of a yellowish mineral that seems
stable, but also crumbles under excessive pressure.  Covering the walls are
holes about a foot in diameter being two foot apart.  It looks as if some
creature, a snake or, a giant worm of some kind that stays hidden underground.
This natural room is very interesting indeed, when you take a close look into
one of the holes you see it is lined with some sort of glowing slime,
appearently whatever animal created the hole is covered in the slime.  The only
exit out of this room, is a man-made hallway to the east.    
