#1147
A Large Cell~
   This room you are in now is a particularly large looking cell, actually it's
the western corner in a long sort of tunnel filled with cells.  It's amazing
what type of dungeon this really is, it was made by some sentient being, or so
you believe, but yet it has such a natural cave look to it.  Most of the cells
are about nine feet long by ten feet wide, and are made it seems only by first
having a long, usually curving, tunnel dug, and then every so far there is a
wall with a door made of steel bars.  This room is no exception to the way the
rest of the dungeon has been made, except for the fact that it's just a few
feet longer due to it being build in a corner.  To the north you see one last
room in this series of cells, but to the east you see another couple of cells.
