lead you to believe that the hallway could easily fit atleast three people from
almost any race standing side by side.  In any case, it's quite large enough
for you to fit through.  You call this a hallway, but it really doesn't
resemble anything like a hallway in a real home, more like a tunnel for herding
prisoners from the dungeon to another place.  Speaking of another place, it
looks as if this path will take you too a mess hall if you continue north, or
atleast from what you can see, it looks like some sort of dining area.  As you
turn your head, you notice something you can't believe you missed before, an
