The Cold Room~
   A breath of cold meets you at the door of this room and stays with you
while you are in it.  The stone sweats, the grating of the floor is beaded
grey with moisture, and a dozen hooks hang from chains in the ceiling, all
of them empty, above a long trough crusted with salt.
~
