#1162
A Rubble-Choked Hall~
   The roof has come down in this hall.  A spill of broken rock fills the
middle of it nearly to the grating, and the fine dust of it rises about your
ankles as you move, though a path has been cleared along the wall and the
stone carried off piece by piece.
~
