rubble rock slab fall~
   The fall has brought one of the great ceiling slabs down whole, and it
lies half buried with its dressed face against the floor.  The rock of it is
not the grey of the walls but a darker stone, shot through with thin stripes
of a pale blue, and the stripes have gone dark wherever the slab is broken.
~
