#1163
The Scratched Chamber~
   This little room has been closed off from the hall by nothing more than
the rock fall outside it, and whoever cleared that path never came in here.
Every wall is covered from grating to ceiling with the angular writing that
is cut into the stones of this place, scratched and wandering ever lower.
~
