#1166
The Chain Store~
   Racks of chain cover the walls of this room, coils of it hung on pegs in
the old way, each coil gone to a rust that flakes at a breath.  Padlocks fill
a bin by the door, and set into the wall above the bin are boards marked out
in painted shapes, one outline for every key that belonged here.
~
