#1169
The Keepers' Common Room~
   This room was where the keepers of this level spent the hours they were
not working.  A ring of blackened stones marks a fire that was lit here many
times, benches stand about it close enough to feel the warmth, and the floor
in front of the largest bench is worn into a hollow by many feet.
