A Keeper's Cell~
   A bunk has been cut into the wall of this cell, with a niche beside it to
hold whatever a person might want close at hand in the night.  Things are
still in the niche: a pin of copper gone green with age, a comb of bone with
several teeth broken out of it, and a flute of the same bone.
~
