#1171
A Small Shrine~
   The room is small and cold and holds nothing but a single block of the
white stone that the pillars outside are made of, set up on end in the middle
of the floor.  Its top is hollowed into a shallow bowl, and the bowl is
stained black as though a fire had been burned in it many, many times.
~
