The Sealed Stair~
   Steps rise out of the floor of this room and climb into the rock, broad
and shallow and worn in the middle, and they end against a wall of fitted
stone after only a few feet.  The wall has been built from the side you are
standing on, its courses laid with care and pointed with something dark.
~
