wall stones mortar crack light~
   The joints of the wall are not quite tight.  Hold your hand to the largest
of them and you will feel a thread of air coming down the stair from somewhere
above, cold and smelling faintly of growing things, and in the deepest part of
the crack there is a thin blue gleam, like the light that runs in stripes along
the great stair that comes down into this place.
